{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-038",
    "title": "归墟开门"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_249",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "众人将灯册交给城中抄写员继续保存，并约定每次改动都要留下日期和姓名。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "倒置城翻转之后，地底空洞露出一条新的通道。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6904,
          "end": 6904
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "通道向上延伸，尽头却不是天空，而是一片被灰雾遮住的灯海。无数灯柱从石壁中探出，灯火大多熄灭，只有最深处一盏微弱地亮着。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6906,
          "end": 6906
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“最后一盏引路灯。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6908,
          "end": 6908
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的声音很轻，像是早已在某份家族账本中见过这个名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6910,
          "end": 6910
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向顾氏旧印：“那盏灯不是顾氏的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6912,
          "end": 6912
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“但顾氏有点亮它的方法。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6914,
          "end": 6914
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“代价？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6916,
          "end": 6916
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有回答。她从袖中取出三枚铜针，分别刺入自己的指尖、腕骨和心口。血沿针身流下，在地面画出一条完整的顾氏旧印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6918,
          "end": 6918
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临抓住她的手：“你要做什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6920,
          "end": 6920
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把债还到我这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6922,
          "end": 6922
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这不是你的债。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6924,
          "end": 6924
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏把灯交给了我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6926,
          "end": 6926
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你可以拒绝。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6928,
          "end": 6928
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我已经拒绝过一次。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6930,
          "end": 6930
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她看向倒置城。城中那些被削平的名字正在一盏盏亮起，许多模糊的影子沿通道向上走来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6932,
          "end": 6932
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这次我想自己决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6934,
          "end": 6934
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻走到她身边：“点灯之后，你的修行根基会被用作灯芯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6936,
          "end": 6936
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“会失去修为？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6938,
          "end": 6938
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“从此无法再凝聚新的灵气。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6940,
          "end": 6940
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向她：“你还可以停下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6942,
          "end": 6942
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抬头看他：“你已经结丹了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6944,
          "end": 6944
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那不代表你必须付出代价。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6946,
          "end": 6946
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果没人点灯，所有人都要付出。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6948,
          "end": 6948
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她拔出心口铜针，血珠没有落地，反而沿着地面旧印流向灯海深处。每经过一座熄灭的灯柱，便有一个名字从石壁中浮出。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6950,
          "end": 6950
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临听见无数陌生人低声说话。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6952,
          "end": 6952
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我还记得。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6954,
          "end": 6954
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不想再回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6956,
          "end": 6956
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我的孩子在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6958,
          "end": 6958
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“别替我决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6960,
          "end": 6960
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "最后一盏灯的灯罩缓缓转向顾长离。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6962,
          "end": 6962
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯罩内没有灯芯，只有一道顾氏旧印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6964,
          "end": 6964
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把手放上去。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6966,
          "end": 6966
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离向前走。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6968,
          "end": 6968
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临挡在她面前：“我可以用残印替你点。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6970,
          "end": 6970
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你已经替很多人承担。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6972,
          "end": 6972
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我还承受得住。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6974,
          "end": 6974
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你承受的是忘记。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6976,
          "end": 6976
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她伸手按住他的胸口：“我不想看着你连自己都忘掉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6978,
          "end": 6978
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离绕过他，将手掌按在灯罩上。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6980,
          "end": 6980
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "最后一盏引路灯没有立刻亮起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6982,
          "end": 6982
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离闭上眼，开始念顾氏家族的旧账。她念出每一名经手人的姓名、每一盏灯的去向、每一笔被改写的日期。念到最后，她的声音开始颤抖。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6984,
          "end": 6984
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏旁支第七代，顾长离。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6986,
          "end": 6986
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯罩内浮出她的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6988,
          "end": 6988
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“未偿债一笔。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6990,
          "end": 6990
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "名字下方出现黑色印记。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6992,
          "end": 6992
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“自愿点灯，承担后果。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6994,
          "end": 6994
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离睁开眼：“我愿意。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6996,
          "end": 6996
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "黑色印记瞬间碎裂。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6998,
          "end": 6998
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "最后一盏灯亮了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7000,
          "end": 7000
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "火焰不是青色，也不是白色，而是普通的黄色，像人间客舍门前的一盏油灯。灯光照向倒置城，城中所有无脸人逐渐长出五官。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7002,
          "end": 7002
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他们先恢复眼睛，再恢复嘴唇，最后才恢复自己的脸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7004,
          "end": 7004
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一个老人走出石楼，向顾长离鞠躬：“谢谢。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7006,
          "end": 7006
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你叫什么？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7008,
          "end": 7008
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老人张开嘴，却没有发出声音。脸上的五官重新变得模糊，最后只留下一个姓氏。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7010,
          "end": 7010
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯火开始向顾长离体内流动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7012,
          "end": 7012
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的气海迅速黯淡，肩上的债契黑纹却全部退回心口。顾长离身体一晃，差点倒下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7014,
          "end": 7014
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临扶住她：“你的灵气呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7016,
          "end": 7016
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“没了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7018,
          "end": 7018
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“能走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-090",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7082,
          "end": 7082
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临抓住陆沉舟的手。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-097",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7314,
          "end": 7314
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天门第二次真正开启。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-098",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7316,
          "end": 7316
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "所有人同时听见一个陌生声音：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-099",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7318,
          "end": 7318
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“归墟开门，旧名归还。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-100",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7320,
          "end": 7320
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "改写台中央的空白，终于写下了第一个完整名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-101",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7322,
          "end": 7322
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不是陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-102",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7324,
          "end": 7324
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "是陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-103",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7326,
          "end": 7326
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟开门那日，城中所有井水同时上涨。门后的风带着旧纸和潮土的味道，吹散了三方旗帜。陆照临让众人先把老人和孩子送出，再由自己与陆沉舟入门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-104",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7328,
          "end": 7328
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "后来者可以从这里开始，也可以选择另一条路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-105",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7330,
          "end": 7330
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-106",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7332,
          "end": 7332
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟门缝扩大后，门内吹出的风带来不同年代的气味。众人闻到稻草、药香、海盐和烧焦的木头，仿佛许多被删去的地方同时重叠。陆沉舟让每个人选择一种气味记住，作为返回的路标。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-107",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7334,
          "end": 7334
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "众人将灯册交给城中抄写员继续保存，并约定每次改动都要留下日期和姓名。新的记录不再只写胜负，也写下犹豫、失误以及没有被选择的道路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-108",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7336,
          "end": 7336
        }
      }
    ],
